      }
    ],
    "description": "AI-powered Tamil language platform — checks Tamil grammar, spelling, verb conjugation, and sandhi errors; converts handwritten Tamil notes to text via OCR; and generates Tamil blog articles. Free for students, writers, and journalists.",
    "featureList": [
      "Tamil grammar and spelling checker",
